    "headline": "Night City Runs Again.\nOctober 20.",
    "subhead": "Standalone story, ten episodes, all-new cast, Trigger back with a reworked look. The trailer is past 2.3 million views. 'A raw story of revenge and redemption.'",
    "description": "Cyberpunk: Edgerunners 2 premieres on Netflix October 20, 2026 — a standalone 10-episode story with a new crew (Roman Carax, Talia Yang, D, Weak Kingsley) from Studio Trigger and CD PROJEKT RED. Sneakz & Beatz on the trailer and what's changed.",
