    "headline": "Buc Wild,\n1979-2026.",
    "subhead": "Timothy 'Buc Wild' Joseph, the on-air foil on Hot 97's most notorious morning show, died Sunday. Star confirmed it on his livestream Wednesday.",
    "description": "Timothy 'Buc Wild' Joseph of Hot 97's 'Star & Buc Wild' has died at 47. Star announced it Sept. 9; cause not confirmed. Sneakz & Beatz on a New York radio era.",
