    "slug": "ye-houston-halloween-tickets-on-sale-nrg-2026",
    "pillar": "hiphop",
    "title": "Ye's Houston Halloween Show Is On Sale Now",
    "headline": "Halloween.\nNRG.\nTickets Are Live.",
    "subhead": "General on-sale for Ye's October 31 stadium show in Houston opened Thursday at 10 a.m. It's his first real Houston concert since 2013.",
    "description": "Tickets for Ye's Oct. 31 Halloween show at NRG Stadium in Houston went on general sale Sept. 10 after a Sept. 8 presale. Dallas Nov. 7 and Phoenix Nov. 21 follow. Sneakz & Beatz on the Houston date.",
    "keywords": [
      "Ye Houston",
      "Ye NRG Stadium",
      "Ye Halloween concert",
      "Kanye West Houston tickets",
      "Ye Live Concert Tour",
      "Bully tour",
      "Ye Dallas AT&T Stadium",
      "Ye Phoenix",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "Halloween. NRG.\nTickets Are Live.",
    "ogAccent": "B8862B",
    "heroCredit": "Amy Harris / Invision / AP via KPRC",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.click2houston.com/news/local/2026/09/02/ye-announces-halloween-concert-at-houstons-reliant-stadium/",
    "heroImage": "https://res.cloudinary.com/graham-media-group/image/upload/c_thumb,q_auto,f_auto,w_1200/media/gmg/UUBJBB7E7ZFF7ODAY6MTYRHAJI.jpg",
    "trendScore": 90,
    "body": "The standing Ye slot, and this time the news is a door opening. Tickets for Ye's Halloween night show at NRG Stadium in Houston went on general sale Thursday, September 10 at 10 a.m. Central, after a presale that started Tuesday the 8th, per the venue's event page as reported by [KPRC](https://www.click2houston.com/news/local/2026/09/02/ye-announces-halloween-concert-at-houstons-reliant-stadium/). Last week the story was \"he added three stadiums.\" This week you can actually buy in.\n\n## What's confirmed\nSaturday, October 31, NRG Stadium (the venue is currently marketed under its Reliant name again). It's the first of three new US dates tacked onto the Ye Live Concert Tour behind *Bully*, his twelfth album, out since March. Arlington's AT&T Stadium follows November 7 and Phoenix's State Farm Stadium closes the run November 21, per [Billboard](https://www.billboard.com/music/rb-hip-hop/kanye-west-us-tour-stadium-shows-dallas-houston-phoenix-1236331481/). Registration for all three still runs through [tour.yeezy.com](https://tour.yeezy.com/); Houston is the one with a live public on-sale right now. If you're in Dallas or Phoenix, keep the registration email handy and watch the venue pages, because the Houston sequence (presale Tuesday, general Thursday) is probably the template.\n\n## Why Houston matters\nYe hasn't played a proper concert in Houston since 2013 on the Yeezus run. His last two visits, both in 2019, were a Sunday Service at Lakewood and a performance inside the Harris County Jail. So this is thirteen years between real shows in a city that's been a Kanye stronghold since the *College Dropout* era. On Halloween. In a stadium. The Chicago homecoming earlier this month pulled 142,000-plus across two nights and turned into a G.O.O.D. Music reunion, so expect the same production: the spherical stage, Earth and moon projected on it, and a set list that runs long.\n\n## Keep it straight\nReport the facts and leave it there. The tour's European leg lost several dates this year to cancellations over his past antisemitic remarks, and that context follows every announcement. It's part of the record. It doesn't change the date.\n\n## For the Sneakz audience\nHouston is the closest stadium stop for most of the South, and Halloween on a Saturday is a travel-worthy night. If you're going: buy through the venue or Ticketmaster only, and don't sleep on the presale codes for Dallas when they land.\n\n## Sources\n- KPRC / Click2Houston - Ye bringing Halloween concert to Houston; tickets now on sale (updated Sept. 10, 2026): https://www.click2houston.com/news/local/2026/09/02/ye-announces-halloween-concert-at-houstons-reliant-stadium/\n- Billboard - Ye announces stadium shows in Dallas, Houston and Phoenix (Sept. 2026): https://www.billboard.com/music/rb-hip-hop/kanye-west-us-tour-stadium-shows-dallas-houston-phoenix-1236331481/\n- Yeezy - Ye tour registration: https://tour.yeezy.com/\n- Wikipedia - Ye Live Concert Tour (routing, background): https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ye_Live_Concert_Tour",
