    "slug": "quavo-qromelife-october-2-pharrell-backwards-ti-video-2026",
    "pillar": "hiphop",
    "title": "Quavo Sets QRÖMELIFE for October 2, With Pharrell Running the Boards",
    "headline": "QRÖMELIFE. October 2.\nPharrell Produced the Whole Thing.",
    "subhead": "Quavo's first solo album since Rocket Power got a date, a cover, and a T.I. video shot in front of the Atlanta flag on Friday. The Migos album he keeps promising comes after.",
    "description": "Quavo announced QRÖMELIFE for Oct. 2, 2026, executive-produced by Pharrell, and dropped the Supo Supreme-directed 'Backwards' video with T.I. on Sept. 11.",
    "keywords": [
      "Quavo QROMELIFE",
      "Quavo new album",
      "Quavo Pharrell",
      "Backwards T.I. video",
      "Quavo October 2",
      "Migos reunion",
      "Rocket Power",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "QRÖMELIFE. OCT 2.\nPHARRELL ON THE BOARDS.",
    "ogAccent": "D4A017",
    "heroCredit": "Brett Davis-IMAGN IMAGES via Reuters Connect / HotNewHipHop",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1009327-quavo-release-date-cover-art-new-album-qromelife",
    "heroImage": "https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/imgprst/2292x1200-fit-81-auto/2026/09/Quavo-Release-Date-Cover-Art-New-Album-QROMELIFE-scaled.jpg",
    "trendScore": 80,
    "body": "Quavo picked Friday to stop teasing. At 11 a.m. on September 11, [@QuavoStuntin](https://x.com/QuavoStuntin/status/2098428253828522147) posted the cover, the title and the date: *QRÖMELIFE*, October 2. Then he put out the \"Backwards\" video with T.I. a few hours later. [HotNewHipHop](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1009327-quavo-release-date-cover-art-new-album-qromelife) has the full rollout.\n\n## The Pharrell of it all\n\nThe headline detail is the credit block. Pharrell executive-produced the album and produced on it, which puts Quavo in the same lane Clipse just walked through with *Let God Sort Em Out*: one producer, one sound, no playlist-bait feature dump. For an artist whose post-Migos output has been scattered between singles, a Takeoff tribute record and guest verses, that's the discipline the project needed. The cover is a close-up of Quavo in glasses that spell out the title.\n\nThree singles are already out: \"Trance (Walk It Down),\" \"HAAVIN,\" and now \"Backwards.\" The T.I. pairing is a generational handoff Atlanta has been due for. Tip was the city's trap architect before Quavo was old enough to drive; putting them on one record in front of the Atlanta flag is a statement about lineage more than a chart play.\n\n!youtube(https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M5PZIuXHIc4)\n\n![Quavo](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/imgprst/2292x1200-fit-81-auto/2026/09/Quavo-Release-Date-Cover-Art-New-Album-QROMELIFE-scaled.jpg \"Brett Davis-IMAGN IMAGES via Reuters Connect / HotNewHipHop|https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1009327-quavo-release-date-cover-art-new-album-qromelife\")\n\nSupo Supreme directed the video; Daps executive produced, per [Power 104.7](https://www.power1047.com/post/quavo-ti-backwards-qromelife-october-2-2026). It's a performance clip, clean and loud, with the flag as the only set dressing that matters.\n\n## Where this sits in the Migos story\n\nQuavo told DJ Greg Street on V-103 this week that a new Migos album and a tour with Offset follow *QRÖMELIFE*. That sequencing is the tell. The solo album is the clearing of the throat; the reunion is the show. He's been saying some version of \"one more Migos album\" since the summer, and the more specific he gets about his own release the more real the group project sounds.\n\n*Rocket Power* in 2023 was grief on wax, and it was received that way. This one is being sold as a Pharrell record, which is a different promise: bounce, space, a producer who knows how to make a Migos flow sound like a new idea. Whether it delivers is an October question. The date is real, the executive producer is real, and the video is already out.\n\n## Sources\n- [Quavo Reveals Release Date & Cover Art For New Album \"QRÖMELIFE\"](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1009327-quavo-release-date-cover-art-new-album-qromelife) — HotNewHipHop, Sept. 11, 2026\n- [QRÖMELIFE OCT 2nd pre save now!](https://x.com/QuavoStuntin/status/2098428253828522147) — @QuavoStuntin, Sept. 11, 2026\n- [Quavo & T.I. Drop \"Backwards\" Video Ahead of QRÖMELIFE](https://www.power1047.com/post/quavo-ti-backwards-qromelife-october-2-2026) — Power 104.7, Sept. 11, 2026\n- [Quavo, T.I. – Backwards (Official Video)](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M5PZIuXHIc4) — QuavoVEVO, Sept. 11, 2026\n",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-13",
    "goLiveAt": "2026-09-13",
