    "trendScore": 70,
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "body": "Quiet weekend for the GOAT. No new record, no new post that moved the timeline past the Durk verdict. So the standing Ye slot goes to the map: where the tour goes next.\n\n## The date\nOctober 24, Gelora Bung Karno Main Stadium, Jakarta. Per [Bandwagon Asia](https://www.bandwagon.asia/articles/ye-kanye-west-brings-globe-stage-to-jakarta-this-october) and The Star, it's Ye's first concert in Indonesia and the only Southeast Asia stop on the 2026 run. Capacity is quoted at up to 77,000, with fans expected from across the region. Tickets went on sale July 29 through yejakarta.com from Rp1,875,000 (roughly $115), per Tempo.\n\n## The stage\nSame 360-degree in-the-round build the Chicago crowd saw, marketed in Jakarta as the Globe Stage: the audience surrounds him, which is how Soldier Field got to roughly 65,000 a night above listed capacity. GBK is Indonesia's national stadium. In-the-round there is a bigger room than anything on the U.S. leg so far.\n\n## After that\nHouston, NRG Stadium, October 31. Arlington, AT&T Stadium, November 7. Phoenix, State Farm Stadium, November 21. The three U.S. dates were announced September 2 and Houston's general on-sale opened September 10. So the fall is: Jakarta, then three Sunbelt stadiums in three weeks.\n\n## What's still open\nVultures 3 has no date; Ty Dolla $ign said August 31 he's still willing to make it. The European cancellations from the spring are on the record. Report the calendar straight and leave it there.\n\n## Sources\n- Bandwagon Asia — YE set for first Indonesia concert with massive Globe Stage show in Jakarta this October: https://www.bandwagon.asia/articles/ye-kanye-west-brings-globe-stage-to-jakarta-this-october\n- The Star, July 28, 2026 — Kanye West to perform in Jakarta in October, his tour's only South-East Asia stop: https://www.thestar.com.my/lifestyle/entertainment/2026/07/28/kanye-west-to-perform-in-jakarta-in-october-his-tour039s-only-south-east-asia-stop\n- Tempo English — Kanye West Jakarta concert 2026: full ticket price list: https://en.tempo.co/read/2115814/kanye-west-jakarta-concert-2026-full-ticket-price-list\n- Billboard, Sept. 2, 2026 — Kanye West adds Houston, Dallas and Phoenix stadium shows: https://www.billboard.com/music/rb-hip-hop/kanye-west-us-tour-stadium-shows-dallas-houston-phoenix-1236331481/\n"
