    "ogHeadline": "WEEZY, BOOSIE,\nAND THE TIGER WALK.",
    "ogAccent": "461D7C",
    "heroCredit": "On3",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.on3.com/news/lane-kiffin-walks-with-lil-wayne-and-boosie-for-lsu-tiger-walk",
    "trendScore": 58,
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "body": "Saturday in Baton Rouge: Lil Wayne on one side of Lane Kiffin, Boosie on the other, Tyrann Mathieu a step behind, and the whole LSU roster walking down Victory Hill behind them.\n\n## The walk\nPer [On3](https://www.on3.com/news/lane-kiffin-walks-with-lil-wayne-and-boosie-for-lsu-tiger-walk) and Yahoo Sports, the Tiger Walk before No. 8 LSU's 6:30 kickoff against Louisiana Tech on September 12 was led by Wayne, Boosie, Kiffin and Mathieu. Boosie was in state for a New Orleans show that night. Wayne, Louisiana's most famous export not named Manning, has been showing up for LSU since the Les Miles years.\n\n## Kiffin's thing\nThis is the second week in a row the new coach has put a celebrity at the front of the walk; Clemson week had one too. Kiffin has always understood that a college program is a brand, and in Louisiana the brand is rap as much as football. Two Hot Boys-era legends walking the team in says the new staff gets the state.\n\n## Why it's on the show\nBecause it's the kind of picture that only happens in the South: a Cash Money legend and the Baton Rouge street poet, both past 40, both still the face of their cities, escorting nineteen-year-olds into a stadium. No single, no beef, no press release. Just presence. That's the culture the show is built to cover.\n\n## Sources\n- On3, Sept. 12, 2026 — Lane Kiffin walks with Lil Wayne and Boosie for LSU Tiger Walk: https://www.on3.com/news/lane-kiffin-walks-with-lil-wayne-and-boosie-for-lsu-tiger-walk\n- Yahoo Sports, Sept. 12, 2026 — Lil Wayne, Boosie walk with Lane Kiffin: https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/lil-wayne-boosie-walk-lane-224318646.html\n"
