    "pillar": "anime",
    "title": "Edgerunners Comes to Overwatch: David and Talia in 2027",
    "headline": "David and Talia\nIn Overwatch.",
    "subhead": "Announced at BlizzCon's Battle.net panel: an Overwatch x Cyberpunk: Edgerunners collaboration in 2027 with cosmetics based on Season 1's David Martinez and Season 2's lead, Talia. Heroes, dates and prices are still unannounced.",
    "description": "Overwatch x Cyberpunk: Edgerunners confirmed for 2027 at BlizzCon, with cosmetics based on David (Season 1) and Talia (Season 2). No heroes or date yet.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-14",
