    "ogHeadline": "DAVID AND TALIA\nIN OVERWATCH.",
    "ogAccent": "F2E600",
    "heroCredit": "CD Projekt Red / Blizzard via Dork",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://readdork.com/gaming/overwatch-cyberpunk-edgerunners-collaboration-2027-eab82a0d89",
    "trendScore": 72,
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "body": "Overwatch has done My Hero Academia, Cowboy Bebop and One-Punch Man. Next up is the anime that made half of you buy a game you'd sworn off.\n\n## What was announced\nSame BlizzCon panel where CD Projekt Red confirmed Cyberpunk 2077 for Battle.net, September 13. Per [Dork](https://readdork.com/gaming/overwatch-cyberpunk-edgerunners-collaboration-2027-eab82a0d89) and CDPR's press release, the Edgerunners collaboration hits Overwatch in 2027 with cosmetics based on David Martinez from Season 1 and Talia, the lead of Season 2. Two pieces of art were shown. That's it for confirmed.\n\n## What isn't confirmed\nWhich heroes wear the skins. Whether Lucy or Rebecca make it. A date. A price. An event name. The hero-mapping list making the rounds on X, the one with David on Hanzo and Rebecca on Tracer, is a 2024 fan post, not Blizzard's. Don't air it as fact.\n\n## Why it lands now\nEdgerunners Season 2 drops October 20 on Netflix, ten episodes, a new crew, Kai Ikarashi directing. Overwatch's Season 5 lands October 6 with the vampire support hero Doctrine. The 2027 collab is the bridge: get you hooked on Talia's story this fall, sell you her look next year. The first season pushed Cyberpunk 2077 back up the Steam charts in 2022. Blizzard is betting the second one can do the same for a shooter.\n\n## The take\nThe collab everybody assumed was Fortnite's turned out to be Blizzard's. For Trigger's characters, that's the right fit: Overwatch is the one hero shooter that already looks like an anime.\n\n## Sources\n- Dork, Sept. 13, 2026 — Overwatch x Cyberpunk: Edgerunners collaboration coming in 2027: https://readdork.com/gaming/overwatch-cyberpunk-edgerunners-collaboration-2027-eab82a0d89\n- CD Projekt Red press center, Sept. 13, 2026 — Cyberpunk 2077 comes to Battle.net: https://press.cdprojektred.com/en/news/1847/cyberpunk-2077-comes-to-battle-net\n- Polygon, Sept. 13, 2026 — Cyberpunk: Edgerunners is Overwatch's next big anime collaboration: https://www.polygon.com/\n"
