    "headline": "Atsu Rides Again\nOctober 1.",
    "subhead": "Sucker Punch's Ghost of Yotei: Complete Edition arrives October 1 with the Echoes of Sekigahara story expansion, a roguelike Most Wanted mode that brings back Jin Sakai, and a free 2.0 patch for everyone.",
    "description": "Ghost of Yotei: Complete Edition hits PS5 Oct. 1, 2026: the Echoes of Sekigahara expansion, a roguelike Most Wanted mode with Jin Sakai, and a $14.99 upgrade.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-15",
    "goLiveAt": "2026-09-15",
    "keywords": [
      "Ghost of Yotei Complete Edition",
      "Ghost of Yotei expansion",
      "Echoes of Sekigahara",
      "Ghost of Yotei Most Wanted mode",
      "Ghost of Yotei Jin Sakai",
      "Ghost of Yotei October 1",
      "Sucker Punch",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX",
      "Black-owned media"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "ATSU RIDES AGAIN\nOCTOBER 1.",
    "ogAccent": "C8262C",
    "heroCredit": "Sucker Punch Productions / PlayStation Blog",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://blog.playstation.com/2026/08/12/ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition-comes-to-ps5-october-1/",
    "trendScore": 72,
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "body": "Last fall's best single-player world is getting a second act. Ghost of Yotei: Complete Edition comes to PS5 on October 1, and if you already own the game, the upgrade is $14.99.\n\n## What's in it\nEchoes of Sekigahara is the story expansion, a new chapter for Atsu set against the battle that decided Japan. Most Wanted is a new roguelike bounty-hunting mode, and Jin Sakai, the Ghost of Tsushima himself, is playable in it. That's the headline for anybody who's been waiting to see the two Ghosts in one place since the first trailer.\n\n## The free part\nPatch 2.0 goes to everyone on October 1 whether you buy the expansion or not. It adds transmogrification, so you can wear the armor you like with the stats you need, and a Beauty of Yotei mode built for exploration and photos. Sucker Punch announced the whole package on the PlayStation Blog on August 12.\n\n## Why now\nOctober 1 puts it three weeks after Wolverine and seven before GTA 6. Sony is stacking its single-player fall so there's something first-party in front of you every few weeks. For the RPG-and-big-world crowd, that's a schedule worth planning a couple of evenings around.\n\n## Sources\n- PlayStation Blog, Aug. 12, 2026, Ghost of Yotei Complete Edition comes to PS5 October 1: https://blog.playstation.com/2026/08/12/ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition-comes-to-ps5-october-1/\n- Push Square, Aug. 2026, Ghost of Yotei: Complete Edition announced: https://www.pushsquare.com/news/2026/08/ghost-of-yotei-complete-edition-announced-includes-new-expansion-game-mode-more\n"
