    "headline": "The Space Jam 11\nIs Back. Dec. 12.",
    "subhead": "Thirty years after the film and ten after the last retro, the Air Jordan 11 'Space Jam' (CT8012-900) drops December 12 at $255 with the '23' heel, Varsity Royal Jumpman, translucent blue outsole, and 'Jumpman Jam' on the box.",
    "description": "Air Jordan 11 'Space Jam' 2026 (CT8012-900) releases Dec. 12 at $255, up $20 from the 'Gamma.' First photos: '23' heel, Varsity Royal Jumpman, icy blue sole.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-15",
