    "ogHeadline": "AJ14 'BLUE FERRARI'\nFALL 2027",
    "ogAccent": "1E5BC6",
    "heroImage": "https://www.sneakerfiles.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari-2027.jpg",
    "heroCredit": "Mock-up via @zSneakerHeadz / Sneaker Files",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari/",
    "trendScore": 90,
    "body": "The 14 spent most of the retro era as the shoe Jordan Brand forgot. Then the Ferrari 14 came back in 2025 and did the numbers, and now the theme is getting a third general-release color. This is a leak, so treat every detail below as reported, not confirmed.\n\n## What's reported\n[Sneaker Files](https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari/) and [@zSneakerHeadz](https://x.com/zSneakerHeadz/status/2097815058013167689) broke the \"Blue Ferrari\" on Sept. 9; [Sneaker Bar Detroit](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari/), [Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/10/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari/) and [House of Heat](https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari-2027) all had it inside 48 hours. The build swaps the red seamless suede of the 2014 original for blue, keeps yellow on the Ferrari-style shield, tongue bar and branding, and runs black on the tongue, laces, liner, midsole and carbon fiber, with a silver midfoot shank and a black outsole hit with blue and yellow. Fall 2027, which in Sneaker Files' calendar means July through September. Adult retail $215. Expected at SNKRS, Foot Locker, Finish Line, Hibbett and Shiekh. Sneaker Files calls it \"slightly\" limited, not a Limited tag.\n\n![Air Jordan 14 'Blue Ferrari' mock-up](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari-2027.webp \"Mock-up via Sneaker Bar Detroit|https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari/\")\n\n## What we don't know\nNo style code. House of Heat's page currently lists IF5015-600, but that's the 2025 red Ferrari SKU, so don't file that. No official images; everything circulating is a render. Nike hasn't said a word, which is normal a year out.\n\n## The Ferrari family tree\nRed Ferrari, 2014, then retroed 2025. Reverse Ferrari in yellow, 2019. Nigel Sylvester's purple WNBA PE this July and a run of college PEs stretched the theme further. The 14 is the shoe [MJ built after his own 550 Maranello](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/michael-jordan-ferrari-550-maranello-air-jordan-14-joopiter-auction-2026), and that car is heading to auction this fall, so the timing of a Blue Ferrari leak is not an accident of the news cycle. Jordan Brand knows what it's doing.\n\n## The 2027 14 slate\nPer Sneaker Files, this joins a heavy AJ14 year: \"Chartreuse\" in January, a Low \"BIN 23\" in June, \"Last Shot\" in the summer. Mowalola's 14 [drops Friday](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/mowalola-air-jordan-14-burnt-red-mule-september-18-2026), and Forest Green arrives on Halloween. The forgotten Jordan is, for the moment, the busiest one on the calendar.\n\n## Sources\n- Sneaker Files, Sept. 9, 2026, Air Jordan 14 \"Blue Ferrari\" releases fall 2027: https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari/\n- Sneaker News, Sept. 10, 2026, Air Jordan 14 \"Blue Ferrari\": https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/10/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari/\n- Sneaker Bar Detroit, Sept. 9, 2026, Air Jordan 14 \"Blue Ferrari\": https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari/\n- House of Heat, Sept. 10, 2026, Air Jordan 14 \"Blue Ferrari\" 2027: https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-14-blue-ferrari-2027\n- @zSneakerHeadz on X, Sept. 9, 2026: https://x.com/zSneakerHeadz/status/2097815058013167689\n",
