    "trendScore": 80,
    "body": "Jordan Brand showed this shoe in a glass case at Fashion Week. Now the retailer photos are out, and the details are better than the case let on.\n\n## What surfaced this week\n[Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/08/21/air-jordan-5-halloween-hq7978-001) updated its page Sept. 8 with in-hand shots from [@floresfittedz_footwear_htxf](https://www.instagram.com/floresfittedz_footwear_htxf/), and [House of Heat](https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-5-halloween-release-date) followed Sept. 10 with retailer product photos from size? and JD Sports. Style HQ7978-001, Black/Multi-Color, $220 adult, full family sizing, Oct. 17. SNKRS shows it as Coming Soon.\n\n## The details\nBlack nubuck upper, orange shark-tooth midsole, an embroidered 23 on the ankle. The Nike Air heel comes in a dual-color finish, and the drop shadows under the 23, the tongue Jumpman and the heel Nike Air are green glow-in-the-dark. The outsole is the icy light-blue glow that made the Bel-Air and Oreo 5s so photogenic under a blacklight. Roman-numeral Air Jordan branding sits on the inner tongue. It is, in other words, a Halloween shoe that doesn't need a pumpkin on it to say Halloween.\n\n![Air Jordan 5 'Halloween' retailer photo](https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pu5wtzfc/production/d45dc6995c769ccb00077a77e4c5dbae049cfa53-2000x1548.jpg/Mens-Air-Jordan-5-Halloween-2026-Retro-size%3F-HQ7978-001-44.jpg \"Photo: size? via House of Heat|https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-5-halloween-release-date\")\n\n## One date note\nHouse of Heat's page metadata says Oct. 27; its headline, body and release calendar say Oct. 17, and Oct. 17 matches Sneaker News and the SNKRS listing. We're going with Oct. 17.\n\n## Where it sits in the holiday slate\nThis is the 5 from [the holiday preview Jordan Brand staged at NYFW](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/jordan-brand-holiday-2026-nyfw-preview-bred-4-fireside-12-sacramento-10-halloween-5), and it drops the same weekend Halloween-themed Jordans usually do, right before the [Fireside 12](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-12-fireside-ct8013-105-october-24-official-look-2026) on Oct. 24. Between this, the AJ1 Low Halloween and the Forest Green 14 on the 31st, October is going to be a dark month for anybody with a budget.\n\n## Sources\n- Sneaker News, updated Sept. 8, 2026, Air Jordan 5 \"Halloween\" HQ7978-001: https://sneakernews.com/2026/08/21/air-jordan-5-halloween-hq7978-001\n- House of Heat, Sept. 10, 2026, Air Jordan 5 \"Halloween\" release date and where to buy: https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-5-halloween-release-date\n",
