    "subhead": "Sept. 17 at 9 a.m. PT: DOOM Event Pass, Haunted Hollow in Warzone, a 64-player Giant Infected mode, new map Quantum, Zombies map Tenshu, and Call of Duty Next set for Sept. 30.",
