    "title": "The Air Jordan 5 'Black Cat' Has a Window: Fall 2027",
    "headline": "The Jordan 5 'Black Cat'\nFinally Has a Window",
    "subhead": "Cancelled from its December 2024 slot and left for dead, the triple-black Air Jordan 5 is now reported for Fall 2027 at $220 under style code FZ2239-001, in full family sizing. Leaked images are already moving.",
    "description": "The Air Jordan 5 'Black Cat' (FZ2239-001) is reported for Fall 2027 at $220 in full family sizing, two years after its December 2024 date was cancelled.",
    "keywords": [
      "Air Jordan 5 Black Cat",
      "Jordan 5 Black Cat 2027",
      "FZ2239-001",
      "Air Jordan 5 Black Cat release date",
      "Jordan 5 Black Cat price",
      "Black Cat Jordan",
      "Air Jordan 2027 release dates",
      "zSneakerHeadz",
      "Jordan Brand Fall 2027",
      "triple black Jordan 5",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX",
      "Black-owned media"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "THE JORDAN 5 'BLACK CAT'\nFINALLY HAS A WINDOW",
    "ogAccent": "1A1A1A",
    "heroImage": "https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/imgprst/2292x1200-fit-81-auto/2026/09/HSgD5lVWMAASL3A-e1789955638241.jpg",
    "heroCredit": "zSneakerHeadz via HotNewHipHop",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1010455-air-jordan-5-black-cat-sneaker-news-2",
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "trendScore": 86,
    "body": "The 3 got one. The 4 got one twice. The 13 got one. The Air Jordan 5 \"Black Cat\" got a release date in 2024 and then got cancelled. Two years later it's back on the calendar.\n\n## The report\nPer [HotNewHipHop](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1010455-air-jordan-5-black-cat-sneaker-news-2) on September 20, citing leaker zSneakerHeadz: Fall 2027, $220, style code FZ2239-001, full family sizing from adults down to toddler. No official Nike or Jordan Brand confirmation yet, so hold \"reported\" in front of every one of those facts. Leaked images are circulating.\n\n## What it looks like\nAll black, top to bottom, in a mix of anthracite, black and off-noir. Leather panels over most of the upper, mesh netting on the sides, the shark-tooth midsole in tonal black, \"23\" on the lateral heel and Nike Air on the back. It's the quiet version of a loud shoe.\n\n## The history\n\"Black Cat\" is the nickname teammates gave Michael Jordan for how he stalked the court. Jordan Brand has turned it into a running series: the 3, the 4 (2006, then again in 2020), the 13. The 5 was originally slotted for December 2024 and pulled before it ever shipped ([HNHH, Sept. 6](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1008774-air-jordan-5-black-cat-sneaker-news)). For a colorway that was never actually released, the demand has been unusual; people have been asking about this pair for two years.\n\n## Where it fits on the 2027 board\nFall 2027 is getting crowded: the 4 \"Fire Red,\" the 6 \"Sport Blue\" with Nike Air, the 9 \"Charcoal,\" the 14 \"Blue Ferrari.\" A tonal 5 next to all of that is the easy cop for people who don't want a story on their feet, just a shape. And at $220 with full family sizing, it's built for volume, not for the resale board.\n\n## The take\nThe 5 doesn't get the love the 3 and 4 get in blackout. This is Jordan Brand's second try at proving it should. Say \"reported\" until a date lands, then start saving.\n\n## Sources\n- [The Air Jordan 5 'Black Cat' is set for a 2027 release](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1010455-air-jordan-5-black-cat-sneaker-news-2) — HotNewHipHop, Sept. 20, 2026\n- [The 'Black Cat' Air Jordan 5 is finally happening](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1008774-air-jordan-5-black-cat-sneaker-news) — HotNewHipHop, Sept. 6, 2026\n- [Air Jordan 4 'Fire Red' returns Fall 2027](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-4-fire-red-2027/) — Sneaker Bar Detroit, Sept. 10, 2026\n- [Air Jordan release dates 2026-2027](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-release-dates/) — Sneaker Bar Detroit\n",
