    "heroCreditUrl": "https://animecorner.me/magic-knight-rayearth-2026-unveils-new-trailer-featuring-theme-songs-additional-cast/",
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "trendScore": 68,
    "body": "Three girls on a field trip to Tokyo Tower fall into another world. If you were watching anime in the mid-90s, you know the rest. The 2026 version is 16 days out.\n\n## The trailer\nReleased September 20, the new promo previews both theme songs: \"Otome no Ken\" by Toaka on the open, \"Seira\" by Yurina Kawaguchi on the close ([Anime Corner](https://animecorner.me/magic-knight-rayearth-2026-unveils-new-trailer-featuring-theme-songs-additional-cast/), [official X](https://x.com/rayearth_info)). Four cast additions: Mamiko Noto as Alcyone, Ayumu Murase as Ascot, Hitomi Ueda as Caldina and Hiroki Yasumoto as Lafarga. Premiere: October 7, 2026.\n\n## The cast and crew\nAyane Sakura is Hikaru, Rumi Okubo is Umi, Rie Takahashi is Fuu. Saori Hayami plays Princess Emeraude, Yuki Ono is Zagato, Yuki Kaji is Clef, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka is Ferio. Yui Miura directs at E&H production, Shigeru Murakoshi handles series composition, Satomi Watanabe on character design. The score is Yuki Kajiura with Takumi Ozawa and Shiho Terada. Kajiura on a CLAMP fantasy is the headline for anyone who grew up on .hack and Madoka.\n\n## Why this one\nRayearth ran in Nakayoshi from 1993 to 1996, six volumes across two arcs, and its 1994 anime was one of the first series to fuse magical-girl and mecha with an isekai frame before anyone used that word. CLAMP is having a year: this, plus the ongoing wave of 90s remakes (Ranma, Yaiba) proving the audience that grew up on them will show up for a faithful redo with modern production.\n\n## What to watch for\nWhether the remake keeps the first arc's ending, which hit harder than anything on kids' TV at the time, and whether E&H's animation holds up against the crowded fall slate. The trailer looks clean. The music is already better than it has any right to be.\n\n## Sources\n- [Magic Knight Rayearth 2026 unveils new trailer featuring theme songs, additional cast](https://animecorner.me/magic-knight-rayearth-2026-unveils-new-trailer-featuring-theme-songs-additional-cast/) — Anime Corner, Sept. 20, 2026\n- [Magic Knight Rayearth 2026 anime reveals additional cast, July 4 world premiere](https://animecorner.me/magic-knight-rayearth-2026-anime-reveals-additional-cast-july-4-world-premiere/) — Anime Corner, June 5, 2026\n- [Magic Knight Rayearth official X](https://x.com/rayearth_info) — X\n",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-21",
