    "headline": "The Diary at 32\nHouston's Perfect Score, Owned at Home",
    "subhead": "Thirty-two years after Scarface went platinum in seven weeks, The Diary still reads as the strongest case for a Southern label keeping its own paper.",
    "description": "Scarface's The Diary turns 32. Rap-A-Lot, Noo Trybe, a No. 2 debut and platinum in seven weeks — the Houston album that made grief a rap subject.",
