    "slug": "dr-donda-west-way-78th-south-shore-ye-unveils-sign-chicago-september-22-2026",
    "pillar": "hiphop",
    "title": "Chicago Names 78th Street Dr. Donda West Way, and Ye Pulled the Sign",
    "headline": "Dr. Donda West Way:\nYe Pulls the Sign",
    "subhead": "Chicago's 7th Ward renamed 78th and South Shore for the Chicago State English chair and Gwendolyn Brooks Center founder. Ye unveiled it himself. Rhymefest, GLC and Don C were beside him.",
    "description": "Chicago honors Dr. Donda West with a 78th Street sign in South Shore. Ye unveiled it on Sept. 22 as Rhymefest, GLC and Don C looked on.",
    "keywords": [
      "Dr. Donda West Way",
      "Donda West street naming",
      "Ye Chicago",
      "Kanye West Donda West",
      "78th Street South Shore Drive",
      "Chicago State University",
      "Gwendolyn Brooks Center",
      "Rhymefest",
      "GLC",
      "Don C",
      "Greg Mitchell 7th Ward",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX",
      "Black-owned media"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "DR. DONDA WEST WAY:\nYE PULLS THE SIGN",
    "ogAccent": "8A5A2B",
    "heroCredit": "CBS News Chicago",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.cbsnews.com/chicago/news/dr-donda-west-honored-street-name-south-shore/",
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "trendScore": 90,
    "body": "Seventy-eighth Street and South Shore Drive has a new brown sign on it. It reads Dr. Donda West Way, and her son wanted to be the one to pull the cover off.\n\n## What happened\nTuesday morning, September 22, at 11 a.m., Chicago's 7th Ward held an honorary street naming for Dr. Donda West on the South Side, [per CBS Chicago](https://www.cbsnews.com/chicago/news/dr-donda-west-honored-street-name-south-shore/). Ye was there in shades. He didn't talk to press. [Complex](https://www.complex.com/music/a/tracewilliamcowen/kanye-west-chicago-donda-street-naming-ceremony) (@Complex) had the lineup around him: Rhymefest, GLC, Don C and Really Doe. [Block Club Chicago](https://blockclubchicago.org/2026/09/22/kanye-west-returns-to-south-shore-for-street-renaming-in-honor-of-his-late-mother/) and [WGN](https://wgntv.com/news/chicago-news/kanye-west-attends-honorary-street-naming-ceremony-for-mother-donda-west-on-chicagos-south-side/) both reported that he insisted on unveiling the sign himself, standing next to Ald. Greg Mitchell.\n\nMitchell hosted. He called her \"a builder of people\" and \"a champion for Black creativity and intellectual excellence.\" Complex caught a moment where Mitchell changed what he was saying halfway through a sentence, apparently because Ye told him to, and the block loved it. Cook County Clerk Monica Gordon, Rhymefest (Che Smith, who now sits on the elected Chicago Board of Education) and GLC all spoke.\n\n![Ye and Dr. Donda West at the Grammys](https://images.complex.com/complex/image/upload/c_crop,h_1081,w_1920,x_0,y_0/g_auto:aoi_768_433_384_216,q_auto,f_avif,c_fill,ar_1.78,w_2048/sanity-new/fp1se1oscckl7qo8d0fb \"Kevin Winter / Getty Images via Complex|https://www.complex.com/music/a/tracewilliamcowen/kanye-west-chicago-donda-street-naming-ceremony\")\n\n## Who she was, beyond \"his mom\"\nThe rap internet mostly knows her as a voice on records. Chicago State knew her as the chair of its English Department. She taught there for close to 30 years and founded the Gwendolyn Brooks Center for Black Literature and Creative Writing. Dr. Garrard McClendon, a CSU professor, nominated her for the sign. At the ceremony he called her work at the school \"transformative.\" She died in 2007 at 58.\n\nSo the sign doesn't honor a celebrity's mother. It honors a Black academic who built a literary institution on the South Side, and whose son turned into one of the biggest pop stars of the century. The order matters, and Chicago put it in the right order today.\n\n## The records are the receipts\nYe has been writing about her for twenty years, and her voice shows up in the work. \"Hey Mama\" on *Late Registration* was the thank-you note before the fame got loud. *Donda* (2021) was named for her and sampled her voice. [Complex notes](https://www.complex.com/music/a/tracewilliamcowen/kanye-west-chicago-donda-street-naming-ceremony) her voice closes out \"Mama's Favorite\" on *BULLY*. The Donda name also sits on the school, and the school is [headed to an October jury trial](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/ye-donda-academy-benjamin-provo-23-million-damages-october-jury-trial-2026). That's the brand side of the name. Tuesday was about the person.\n\n## Why Rhymefest on the mic matters\nRhymefest and Ye go back to \"Jesus Walks,\" and they fell out in public. The Donda's House nonprofit Fest ran in her name was [renamed in 2020](https://www.pbs.org/video/dondas-house-renamed-after-kanye-west-rhymefest-beef-joqgvq) after that split. Six years later he's at the microphone at her corner, with Ye a few feet away. Neither man said anything to reporters about it, so don't read it as a reunion. But in Chicago, standing up at the same ceremony still counts for something.\n\n## The Chicago run\nThis is Ye's second big hometown moment in a month. He did [two record nights at Soldier Field](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/ye-soldier-field-pollstar-record-29-8-million-two-nights-2026) earlier in September. Up next are Jakarta on October 24, then Houston on Halloween. Stadiums pay. A street sign on 78th is something you can't buy, and it outlasts the tour.\n\n## Sources\n- [Dr. Donda West, scholar and mother of Kanye West, honored with street name in South Shore](https://www.cbsnews.com/chicago/news/dr-donda-west-honored-street-name-south-shore/) — CBS Chicago, Sept. 22, 2026\n- [Ye Honors Late Mother Donda West With Attendance at Chicago Street Naming Ceremony](https://www.complex.com/music/a/tracewilliamcowen/kanye-west-chicago-donda-street-naming-ceremony) — Complex, Sept. 22, 2026\n- [Kanye West Returns To South Shore For Street Renaming In Honor Of His Late Mother](https://blockclubchicago.org/2026/09/22/kanye-west-returns-to-south-shore-for-street-renaming-in-honor-of-his-late-mother/) — Block Club Chicago, Sept. 22, 2026\n- [Kanye West attends honorary street naming ceremony for mother Donda West](https://wgntv.com/news/chicago-news/kanye-west-attends-honorary-street-naming-ceremony-for-mother-donda-west-on-chicagos-south-side/) — WGN, Sept. 22, 2026\n- [Kanye West Attends Chicago Street Naming In Honor Of His Mother](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1010616-kanye-west-dr-donda-west-way-chicago) — HNHH, Sept. 22, 2026\n- [Donda's House renamed after Kanye West / Rhymefest beef](https://www.pbs.org/video/dondas-house-renamed-after-kanye-west-rhymefest-beef-joqgvq) — PBS / WTTW\n",
    "heroImage": "https://assets3.cbsnewsstatic.com/hub/i/r/2026/09/22/e35b38f8-bcba-4069-bfb2-153c533ea932/thumbnail/1200x630/44a947b6aa139805227a211d3806c8bc/dr-donda-west-way.jpg",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-22",
    "goLiveAt": "2026-09-22"
