    "body": "Last week we had [the 16 on its own](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-16-black-pack-iz2586-001-first-look-october-3-245-nbhd-2026). Now Jordan Brand has all four in one photo, and the pack is split across two release days.\n\n## What dropped\nOn Wednesday, September 23, Jordan Brand put the full \"Black Pack\" up on its new preview site, 232323232323.com (that's 23 six times). [Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/23/air-jordan-black-pack-release-date/) (via [@sneakernews](https://x.com/sneakernews)) ran the campaign images. It's the first time the four shoes have been shown together: Air Jordan 14 Low, 15, 16 and 17, all black, covering MJ's last Bulls title run through the Wizards years.\n\n![Air Jordan Black Pack campaign image.](https://sneakernews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/air-jordan-black-pack-release-date-4.jpg \"Jordan Brand via Sneaker News|https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/23/air-jordan-black-pack-release-date/\")\n\n## Each one gets its own leather\n- **Air Jordan 14 Low:** ostrich texture on the sidewalls.\n- **Air Jordan 15:** snakeskin.\n- **Air Jordan 16:** wrinkled elephant leather with a glossy patent toe.\n- **Air Jordan 17:** dark grey suede on the sides with stingray collars.\n\nThis is how the 14 through 17 should be done. They were always the luxury Jordans of MJ's late career. Exotic textures in all black is the right call.\n\n## The dates\n- **October 3:** Air Jordan 14 Low and Air Jordan 16.\n- **November 7:** Air Jordan 15 and Air Jordan 17.\n\nEarlier reporting had the 16 at $245 through NBHD retailers. Sneaker News hasn't listed prices for the other three yet.\n\n![Air Jordan Black Pack, second campaign image.](https://sneakernews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/air-jordan-black-pack-release-date-1.jpg \"Jordan Brand via Sneaker News|https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/23/air-jordan-black-pack-release-date/\")\n\n## The read\nJordan Brand has been pushing the early-2000s models all year, through Free the Youth, Infinite Archives and Doernbecher. This pack is the payoff: four shoes most people skipped the first time, packaged as a set. The 14 Low will move first. The 17 with stingray is the one people will wish they bought in November.\n\n## Sources\n- Sneaker News, Sept. 23, 2026: [Jordan Brand Reveals The Complete \"Black Pack\"](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/23/air-jordan-black-pack-release-date/)\n- Sneaker News: [Jordan Release Dates hub](https://sneakernews.com/air-jordan-release-dates/)\n",
