    "headline": "Social Status x AJ1 Low OG:\nFirst Look.",
    "subhead": "The Whitaker Group shop's Jordan 1 Low surfaced Wednesday: aged 'Chicago' red, a blue Sashiko-style woven midfoot, Holiday 2026. No price or date yet.",
