    "body": "Social Status' Jordan 1 Low has been a rumor since spring. Now there are photos, and it's a Chicago-blocked 1 Low with a handmade twist.\n\n## What dropped\n[Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/23/social-status-air-jordan-1-low-og/) posted the first teaser images Wednesday, September 23. They came from the same Jordan Brand holiday preview that revealed [SoleFly's AJ5](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/solefly-air-jordan-5-iu0734-001-official-lookbook-boxing-laces-october-8-2026) and the full [Black Pack](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-black-pack-full-reveal-14-low-16-october-3-15-17-november-7-2026). The shots are tightly cropped, so there's more to see.\n\n## The shoe\n- **Chicago blocking:** red overlays around a lighter base. The red looks intentionally worn, like a pair that's been in rotation for years.\n- **The midfoot:** a blue textile replaces the usual leather. Sneaker News says it looks like a Sashiko-style weave, the Japanese hand-stitch technique used to reinforce workwear.\n- **Red, white and blue:** that lines up with earlier reports on the colorway.\n\n![Social Status x Air Jordan 1 Low OG detail.](https://sneakernews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/social-status-air-jordan-1-low-og-2.jpg \"Jordan Brand via Sneaker News|https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/23/social-status-air-jordan-1-low-og/\")\n\n## Date and price\nHoliday 2026. No price, no style code, no exact date yet.\n\n## The read\nSocial Status is part of James Whitaker's Whitaker Group, alongside A Ma Maniere. That makes it one of the few Black-owned boutique groups Jordan Brand keeps giving real product to. Their Jordans usually come with a story behind the materials, and the Sashiko panel is the clue here. Until the full reveal, it's a Chicago-colored 1 Low with a patch of indigo workwear in the middle, and that's already more interesting than half of this year's 1 Lows.\n\n## Sources\n- Sneaker News, Sept. 23, 2026: [First Look At The Social Status x Air Jordan 1 Low OG](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/23/social-status-air-jordan-1-low-og/)\n",
