    "title": "Tee Grizzley's 'They Forgot' and Skyzoo's 'Luxury Tax' Out",
    "headline": "Detroit Remembers.\nSkyzoo Sends the Bill.",
    "subhead": "Two very different Friday albums: Tee Grizzley's 16-track They Forgot on 300, and Apollo Brown and Skyzoo's Luxury Tax, ten years after The Easy Truth.",
    "description": "Tee Grizzley's They Forgot and Apollo Brown and Skyzoo's Luxury Tax both land Friday, Sept. 25. What's on each, the singles, and why they're worth your time.",
