    "slug": "ye-donda-academy-trial-delay-request-may-2027-russia-shows-milo-yiannopoulos-2026",
    "pillar": "hiphop",
    "title": "Ye Asks to Push Donda Academy Trial to May 2027",
    "headline": "Ye Wants the Trial Moved.\nRussia Has No Stadium.",
    "subhead": "Ye's lawyers want the Oct. 12 Donda Academy trial moved to May 2027, citing St. Petersburg concerts that lost their venue and a key witness who was deported.",
    "description": "Ye asked a judge to move the $23M Donda Academy trial from Oct. 12 to May 2027, citing Russia shows with no venue and a deported witness. No ruling yet.",
