    "body": "A 20-year-old women's exclusive is on SNKRS this morning.\n\n## The details\n- **Shoe:** Air Jordan 5 \"Sunset\" (women's)\n- **Style code:** IV5678-102\n- **Colorway:** White/Sunset-Fire Red-Black\n- **Price:** $205\n- **Sizes:** women's, up to W12 (roughly men's 10.5)\n- **Release:** today, Friday, September 25\n\n## Where to buy\n[Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/24/air-jordan-5-sunset-store-list/) has US pairs on Nike SNKRS. [SneakerFiles](https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-5-sunset-2026/) also lists Foot Locker, Finish Line, Shiekh, Hibbett and DSG, and [Sneaker Bar Detroit](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-5-sunset-2026/) says SNKRS plus select retailers. Start with SNKRS, then check the retailers' apps.\n\n## What it is\nThe \"Sunset\" first dropped in 2006 as a women's exclusive and has never been a guys' pair. White leather base, translucent mesh, the reflective 3M tongue, orange shark teeth on the midsole, and Fire Red on the liner, heel Jumpman and outsole. It already launched in Europe earlier this year and got pushed back in the US from its original July 1 date, per SneakerFiles. The shape follows the recent AJ5 retros, slightly adjusted from the 2006 last.\n\n![Air Jordan 5 Sunset IV5678-102](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/air-jordan-5-sunset-iv5678-102-release-date.webp \"Sneaker Bar Detroit (photo: lemkus_)|https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-5-sunset-2026/\")\n\n## Why it's worth your time\nMost of the AJ5 conversation is about the Fire Reds, Grapes and Metallics. The Sunset is a deep cut, from the mid-2000s run when Jordan Brand started taking women's colorways seriously instead of shrinking and pinking men's pairs. A white-orange 5 with the reflective tongue is summer-into-fall versatile, and at women's sizing guys up to about 10.5 can get in.\n\nAt $205 it's standard 2026 retro pricing. Resale on women's AJ5s usually stays close to retail, so if you miss it, don't panic.\n\n## Sources\n- Sneaker News, Sept. 24, 2026: [Air Jordan 5 \"Sunset\" store list](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/24/air-jordan-5-sunset-store-list/)\n- SneakerFiles: [Air Jordan 5 \"Sunset\" 2026](https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-5-sunset-2026/)\n- Sneaker Bar Detroit: [Air Jordan 5 \"Sunset\" 2026](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-5-sunset-2026/)\n",
